cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Shopify Checkout Lab
message: >-
  If you use this code, or build on the patterns it demonstrates, please credit
  the author and link back to this repository.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Real merchant tickets solved with Shopify Functions. Each ticket is a working
  Function with its input query, its merchant settings in a metafield and its
  tests, and each one is playable in the browser at nicolasmateos.com/#lab,
  running the same source file that lives in this repository.
